view D key breeze origin -1 3 layer head
|.QQQQ.....
|QPOSSQQ...
|QRSSSSSQQ.
|.QRSSTSSSQ
|..QRSTSRSQ
|...QRTSRSQ
|....QRSRTQ
|.....QRRTQ
|......QRRQ
|.......QQQ
